		{"id":"31edb38be6bf60a8","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/js/preloader/Preloader.md","subpath":"#^ca5d32","x":1290,"y":3623,"width":400,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"dd24012f7bc82cb3","type":"text","text":"#3 · Unlock at `exit`, not after the outro (S)\n`unlockScroll()` sits in `finally`, after `runExit` awaits the logo (`--preloader-step-stagger`×2 + step = 0.8s). Unlock and dispatch `preloader:out` as soon as `exit` is set; the fade-out plays over an already-scrollable page.","x":1280,"y":3930,"width":420,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7ebc6629216b11ae","type":"text","text":"## 📢   background.video.playing","x":790,"y":3794,"width":400,"height":50},
		{"id":"ccefee84aa4d3bb1","type":"text","text":"## intro landed already?","x":1365,"y":2429,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"51513c315ca3afeb","type":"text","text":"##  📢   document.fonts.ready","x":720,"y":2912,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"3b1db302d721db09","type":"text","text":"## 📢  system.directorReady","x":720,"y":2987,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"de7646d3ab7640a0","type":"text","text":"## 📢   background.video.canplay","x":720,"y":3064,"width":400,"height":50},
