		{"id":"2a269eb0bcf99618","type":"text","text":"📍deferred videos hydrated (`src` set)\n📍background video `playing` (≤4000ms)","x":720,"y":3542,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"11335b919cdb2dde","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/js/preloader/Preloader.md","subpath":"#^b3f101","x":720,"y":2405,"width":400,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ec3369c90abb3e81","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/js/preloader/Preloader.md","subpath":"#^d8447f","x":720,"y":2615,"width":400,"height":168,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"81d683efb227e38e","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/js/preloader/Preloader.md","subpath":"#^e82137","x":1290,"y":1997,"width":400,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"789a6fe0a4363363","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/js/preloader/Preloader.md","subpath":"#^66dc4a","x":720,"y":2022,"width":400,"height":97,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"39c94d835d8575c3","type":"text","text":"## First Visit?","x":720,"y":2239,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"335ef51f59907bb6","type":"text","text":"## reduced motion?","x":1365,"y":2329,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"2c59021781419891","type":"text","text":"#1 · Hydrate before the gates (S)\n`hydrateDeferredVideos()` runs only after `fonts.ready` **and** `director:ready`, so the hero mp4 request waits on DCL → bundle eval → idle ≤150ms → constructor. Call it before `await fontsReady()` (or inline `src` + `preload=metadata` on the hero video only) so the fetch overlaps the whole boot.","x":80,"y":3732,"width":420,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5e5dbd182498a998","type":"text","text":"### No effect on home\n`overflow: hidden` only blocks native user scroll. ScrollSmoother (`normalizeScroll: true`) is created later by the Director and drives scroll programmatically, bypassing the lock. Real lever: `smoother.paused(true)` — reachable only after `director:ready`.","x":80,"y":2365,"width":420,"height":223,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"faa7368fa935ad5d","type":"text","text":"📢 preloader:out (≤8000ms)","x":1840,"y":3517,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"efd16b2e7fdf1b7d","type":"text","text":"### 📍 FCP\nFirst contentful paint: paint-timing entry, not a lifecycle state. Not ordered against `interactive`: the first frame renders once CSSOM + DOM allow; on home the parse (~50–110ms) usually finishes first. CSS intro starts here.","x":-1000,"y":2716,"width":400,"height":243,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"66b4ae5a03980b47","type":"text","text":"## 📢  document.fonts.ready","x":-1000,"y":2615,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"0cf3614277a1991f","type":"text","text":"## 📢 DOMContentLoaded (event)\nFires as soon as the head/body module scripts have run — the bundle is still in flight (its fetch starts at the same ms as DCL, measured). Bundle evaluates after; `scheduleInit` sees `readyState !== \"loading\"` and calls `requestIdleCallback(initDirector, {timeout: 150})` directly.","x":-1000,"y":3114,"width":420,"height":265,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"6cd58ceb5a4f30b7","type":"text","text":"## 📢 preloader.finished","x":1840,"y":2920,"width":400,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c78c85606fbc087d","type":"text","text":"## 📢 preloader.hidden","x":1840,"y":3054,"width":400,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"35035f26810ea75b","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/js/preloader/preloader-states.canvas","x":2380,"y":1885,"width":400,"height":2275,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6e4d68efcb1b68f3","type":"text","text":"#4 · Await the gates together (S)\nGates are serial: `fontsReady` → `directorReady` → hydrate → `videoPlaying` → `intro`. Only the outro needs all of them. `Promise.all` them so the *slowest* gate bounds the splash, not the sum.","x":80,"y":3097,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d49523193269227c","type":"text","text":"#2 · Soften the `playing` gate (S)\n≤4000ms is the largest single gate, and on slow links it is the one that trips. The poster is already painted (eager fetch at parse). Gate on `loadedmetadata`/`canplay` — or not at all — and fade the video in on `playing`.","x":80,"y":3282,"width":420,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"72ff4e2c95433b7d","type":"text","text":"## 📍Hydrate Deferred Videos\n`hydrateDeferredVideos()` — `video.src = data-src; load()` (`preload=metadata`). Hero background mp4 + card videos request **now**, after `director:ready`; background `play()` pulls the full stream","x":80,"y":3480,"width":420,"height":198,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"297b4dccfe225d87","type":"text","text":"## 📢   background.video.canplay","x":3140,"y":2981,"width":400,"height":50},
		{"id":"f78d58da70ca8202","type":"text","text":"## Q: When is the video ready for playback (even if it has not fully loaded yet)?","x":4240,"y":2905,"width":400,"height":101,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2ffa87a493991f05","type":"text","text":"## Q: When does the background video begin to dlownload?","x":4240,"y":3023,"width":400,"height":105,"color":"1"},
